The contents of this repository are factual checklist data: card numbers, names
as printed, and teams. Facts are not subject to copyright. This dedication makes
that explicit and removes any doubt for downstream consumers.

Card set names, player names, team names and logos are trademarks of their
respective owners. This repository is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by any card manufacturer or sports league. No manufacturer artwork,
scans, or checklist documents are redistributed here — only derived facts.
